window.bookSummaryJSON = "<p>Rule #4 of Wall Street: Keep your enemies close</p> <p>The Vampire King wasn't on the invite list for our engagement party, but that won't stop him from demanding his due.</p> <p>He insists Madi and I make an appearance at his club.</p> <p>He wants a performance where we're the players.</p> <p>I would refuse—war be damned, but my bride is intrigued.</p> <p>And what she wants, she gets.</p> <p>Mated <i>is a bonus story from the completed</i> Big Bad Boss <i>trilogy featuring a billionaire boss-hole wolf shifter and his freakishly smart assistant.</i></p>"; 
